      "source_number": "137",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Hmm. Well, stranger, I work for Gizmo. He's the owner of that great casino there. Pays good money to fighters here, too! What else do you want to know?",
      "source_text": "Hmm. Well, stranger, I work for Gizmo. He's the owner of that great\n casino there. Pays good money to fighters here, too! What else do you want to\n know?",
